7972 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Shut the Sash Lambton is a pilot sustainability initiative at Lambton College designed to reduce laboratory energy use and greenhouse gas \050GHG\051 emissions while reinforcing safe laboratory practices\056 The project couples sash\055position sensors on selected research fume hoods with a targeted awareness and behaviour\055change campaign that encourages lab users to close fume hood sashes when not actively in use\056 Because laboratory fume hoods are among the most energy\055intensive systems in research facilities\054 this simple behaviour change can significantly reduce ventilation energy demand without impacting research productivity\056 \n\nThe initiative integrates applied research\054 facilities operations\054 and student engagement to establish a scalable model for safer\054 lower\055carbon laboratory operations\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 7973 0 R
     /Pg 5414 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

