  << /ActualText (Lambton College project will continue the pilot part of ongoing laboratory sustainability efforts at Lambton College\056 With new air handling units installed\054 the project team will continue collecting data to quantify energy\054 cost\054 and GHG impacts\056 Next steps include completing data analysis\054 producing a report documenting performance and lessons learned\054 and using the results to support scaling the program to additional laboratories across campus\056)
