7996 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Cause a Scene transformed Algonquin College\031s DARE District into a public\055facing climate awareness experience through art and interactive technology\056 Inspired by the DARE District\031s three\055storey Indigenous mural\054 the initiative launched on Nov\056 13\054 2025 with a multigenerational climate dialogue and featuring Chuck Commanda \050Indigenous Knowledge Keeper\051\054 Vanessa Stevens \050Mamidosewin Centre\051\054 and Amenda Soucy \050Inuk student entrepreneur\054 Business Management and Entrepreneurship\051\056 The dialogue invited employees\054 learners\054 and community members to reflect on responsibilities to land and future generations\056\n\nFollowing the dialogue\054 Illustration and Concept Art learners created nine large\055scale murals and interactive activations across the first and second floors\056 The project was delivered through collaboration between the Social Innovation Lab and the Algonquin College Makerspace Innovation team\054 further engaging students from the Business Management and Entrepreneurship program and the Interactive Media Design Program to capture media content from the day\054 creating a highlight video and a virtual gallery of the artwork\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 7997 0 R
     /Pg 5982 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

