8020 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The BCIT Energy Awareness Campaign was an institute\021wide initiative designed to educate and engage students\054 faculty\054 and staff in reducing energy use and greenhouse gas \050GHG\051 emissions through behaviour change\056 The campaign featured events\054 visual displays\054 digital communications\054 and interactive quizzes focused on energy conservation\054 behaviour change\054 and fostering sustainable habits across campus to connect everyday actions with BCIT\031s broader energy and sustainability goals\056\n\nA key component of the campaign was the integration of Indigenous perspectives\056 The project team invited an Indigenous staff member to share his insights on energy conservation and environmental stewardship through an educational video\056 This approach deepened participants\031 understanding of sustainable practices and highlighted the importance of respecting the Earth in how we produce and use energy\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 8021 0 R
     /Pg 6514 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

