8044 0 obj
  << /ActualText (An novel composting program has been created at UCN The Pas campus with vermicomposting colonies established in UCN\031s passive solar greenhouse\056 As a vibrant reminder of the program\031s purpose\054 a mural artwork was created by a renowned Winnipeg artist\054 with contributions from local high school students\056 The program and artwork emphasize the stewardship role humans share for wildlife\054 soil\054 water\054 and air\056\n\nProject contributors have propagated the vermicompost colonies in the greenhouse and have been developing measurement protocols and additional composting methods in support of the overarching goal\056 Internal and external collaboration has brought this project momentum and is promising for continued growth and research\056\n)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 8045 0 R
     /Pg 7060 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

